@title Crane in 3D: the state lamps are explained behind the "?"
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768
# The "?" of the Hoist in 3D window says what the two lamps on the control box show and when they light.
open qa/fixtures/travel-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 120
click 1266 103
wait 20
expect "The two lamps on the crane's control box"
expect "dark otherwise"
shot lamps-help
key Escape
check_layout
